{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2021-09-13 18:22:00', 'title': 'PENTAGON AND LOCKHEED MARTIN AGREE TO F-35 SUSTAINMENT CONTRACTS', 'text': 'FORT WORTH, TEXAS, SEPT. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE F-35 JOINT PROGRAM OFFICE AWARDED THE LOCKHEED MARTIN (NYSE: LMT) INDUSTRY TEAM\xa0ANNUALIZED CONTRACTS COVERING FISCAL YEARS 2021-2023 TO SUPPORT OPERATIONS AND SUSTAINMENT OF THE GLOBAL F-35 FLEET, SUPPORTING MISSION READINESS AND FURTHER REDUCING COSTS.'}